  "description": "A stealth HTTP client library for .NET that bypasses Cloudflare / DataDome and most TLS handshake security measures using advanced browser TLS fingerprinting. The Go tls-client engine runs out-of-process as a local sidecar (auto-downloaded on first use), so it never crashes the host on Linux and needs no Node.js. Supports multiple browser profiles (Chrome, Firefox, Safari), randomized TLS extension order, header-order control, cookie management, and proxies.",
